---
title: 冷链仓库改造排期
config:
  themeVariables:
    doneTaskBorderColor: '#6ee7b7'
    activeTaskBorderColor: '#7dd3fc'
    critBorderColor: '#fb7185'
---
gantt
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %m/%d
    excludes weekends
    section 设计与采购
    现场测绘与需求冻结 :done, survey, 2025-03-03, 5d
    制冷方案审查       :done, review, after survey, 4d
    压缩机交付         :active, compressor, after review, 8d
    section 施工与联调
    拆除旧机组         :crit, demolition, 2025-03-24, 4d
    管线与电控改造     :crit, piping, after demolition, 7d
    压缩机安装         :install, after compressor, 4d
    系统联调与温度验证 :active, commissioning, after piping install, 5d
    温控验收           :milestone, accept, after commissioning, 0d
    section 切换运营
    库存分区搬迁       :move, after accept, 3d
    新仓正式启用       :milestone, launch, after move, 0d
